674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NFZeivLhgJkQ7kNvwGhswbo&_nc_oc=AdopBjG5NBtgJuMDcbk70PZ17traaAZ2Y88etiqRxoA2uBhD5pZ8m-JTzWWhv1rTsO0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIIiFmqnPNppAjgcKehlOno3K3REg2Gk_PgCSB2Q54bZA&oe=6A9C27D9"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MbUK1BDlAJwQ7kNvwHidcRH&_nc_oc=Adq60WQ7Ptue-pV5X6nWbWhAfRcllJxgbIuKsGA8umbxMru_X5pdVOb3S37VpG8DHZ4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ969rip3HRSAc8cZjGuVM7tdjSDHyXhDFEpkEEtV9zow&oe=6A9C3096"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zIEjhMj6pKoQ7kNvwFSLC5v&_nc_oc=Adpd6QMmfm_fldsFHZTqIuMyyPno_SYFAL3-ldMrQ0OfMhxNX3Bc_C8vVYLJYAhZklw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJluZ-50it3Z-i8TdEFWtO-eDtCtErCbat_qknMKAQBJw&oe=6A9C2CB1"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip